{
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "distant_lights",
      "weight": 30,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "color": "0xBDF7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "The distant lights go out one by one.",
              "audio": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "The sea still remembers where they were.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x8CF3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "By dawn, only the mist remains.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sea_waves_talk",
      "weight": 100,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "color": "0xF800",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Dad, why do sea waves keep crying?",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Because they're sad that they're knocking over the sand castles.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xF800",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Then they should just not knock them over.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Waves move with the winds.",
              "audio": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "When the wind blows, the high and low tides can't help but knock down everything in their path.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xF800",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Then why not just... push back when the wind blows?",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Think about it this way, darling.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "The waves... built those sand castles only because the wind pulled them in.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "And now, the wind is pushing them to bring the castles down.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0x07FF",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "So the waves really have no reason to feel sad.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xF800",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Then, Dad...",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xF800",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "... when will they be happy?",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "under_current",
      "weight": 25,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "color": "0x9D96",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Stillness belongs only to the surface.",
              "audio": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "Far below, the currents continue chasing one another.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xC638",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Do not hurry to give them names.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shoreline",
      "weight": 20,
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "color": "0xCE17",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Every wave reaches the same shore.",
              "audio": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "No two waves take the same path.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "color": "0xFF1B",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "You are hearing only one of them.",
              "audio": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}